(function(E){ const x = E["mkt-m3"] = E["mkt-m3"] || {units:{}}; x.units["mkt-cp-3"] = {"exit":{"id":"c-mkt-cp-3-x","course":"marketing","unit":"mkt-cp-3","type":"exit","items":[{"from":"mkt-1","kind":"blank","prompt":"Our team ___ write only in Turkish.","options":["used to","use to","is used to"],"correct":0,"point":2,"why":{"en":"used to: a past habit that stopped. 'Use to' needs did, and 'is used to' means 'is familiar with'.","tr":"used to: artık olmayan geçmiş bir alışkanlık. 'Use to' did ister; 'is used to' 'alışkın' demektir.","fa":"used to درست است، چون عادت گذشته‌ای است که تمام شده. use to did لازم دارد و is used to یعنی «عادت دارد»."}},{"from":"mkt-3","kind":"blank","prompt":"Writers ___ use our logo without permission.","options":["don't have to","must to","mustn't"],"correct":2,"point":2,"why":{"en":"mustn't: using the logo without permission is not allowed. 'Don't have to' makes it optional, and 'must to' is not English.","tr":"mustn't: logoyu izinsiz kullanmak yasaktır. 'Don't have to' isteğe bağlı yapar; 'must to' İngilizce değildir.","fa":"mustn't درست است، چون استفاده از لوگو بدون اجازه ممنوع است. don't have to آن را اختیاری می‌کند و must to انگلیسی نیست."}},{"from":"mkt-5","kind":"blank","prompt":"She took a ___ English course before the launch.","options":["ten-weeks","ten weeks","ten-week"],"correct":2,"point":2,"why":{"en":"ten-week: a number before a noun is an adjective: hyphen, and no -s. 'Ten-weeks' adds -s, and 'ten weeks' can't sit before course.","tr":"ten-week: isimden önce gelen sayı sıfattır: tire ve -s yok. 'Ten-weeks' -s ekler; 'ten weeks' course'tan önce gelemez.","fa":"ten-week درست است، چون عدد قبل از اسم صفت است: با خط تیره و بدون ‎-s. ten-weeks ‎-s دارد و ten weeks قبل از course نمی‌آید."}},{"from":"mkt-7","kind":"blank","prompt":"The new fabric ___ for harmful substances last month.","options":["was tested","tested","was test"],"correct":0,"point":2,"why":{"en":"was tested: the fabric received the action last month, so was + past participle. 'Tested' alone says the fabric tested something; 'was test' drops -ed.","tr":"was tested: kumaş geçen ay eylemi aldı, bu yüzden was + üçüncü hâl. Tek başına 'tested' kumaşın bir şeyi test ettiğini söyler; 'was test' -ed'i düşürür.","fa":"was tested درست است، چون پارچه ماه پیش آزمایش شد و was و اسم مفعول لازم است. tested تنها یعنی پارچه چیزی را آزمایش کرده و was test ‎-ed ندارد."}},{"from":"mkt-9","kind":"mcq","prompt":"Which reply to a complaint is best?","options":["We apologise for any inconvenience.","We're sorry that our label was wrong; we have changed it.","Please read our care guide."],"correct":1,"point":1,"why":{"en":"It names the exact problem and the fix. 'Any inconvenience' sounds like a form letter, and 'read our care guide' puts it back on the customer.","tr":"Sorunun tam adını ve çözümünü söyler. 'Any inconvenience' kalıp mektup gibi duyulur; 'read our care guide' sorunu yine müşteriye bırakır.","fa":"دقیقاً مشکل و راه‌حل را می‌گوید. «any inconvenience» شبیه نامه‌ی آماده است و «read our care guide» مشکل را دوباره گردن مشتری می‌اندازد."}},{"from":"mkt-10","kind":"blank","prompt":"Since the launch, we ___ over 1,000 mugs.","options":["sold","are selling","have sold"],"correct":2,"point":2,"why":{"en":"have sold: 'since the launch' runs until now, so use the present perfect. 'Sold' is for finished time, and 'are selling' doesn't go with since.","tr":"have sold: 'since the launch' bugüne kadar sürer, bu yüzden present perfect. 'Sold' bitmiş zaman içindir; 'are selling' since ile kullanılmaz.","fa":"have sold درست است، چون since the launch تا الان ادامه دارد و حال کامل می‌خواهد. sold برای زمان تمام‌شده است و are selling با since نمی‌آید."}},{"from":"mkt-11","kind":"mcq","prompt":"What makes a customer quote safe to publish?","options":["It sounds great.","The customer said it and approved it.","The AI tool wrote it."],"correct":1,"point":3,"why":{"en":"The customer said it and approved it: only then is the quote safe. Sounding great or being written by an AI tool is no permission.","tr":"Müşteri söyledi ve onayladı: alıntı ancak o zaman güvenlidir. Kulağa harika gelmesi ya da yapay zekânın yazması izin değildir.","fa":"مشتری خودش آن را گفته و تأییدش کرده؛ فقط آن وقت نقل‌قول امن است. خوب به نظر رسیدن یا نوشته شدن با هوش مصنوعی اجازه نیست."}},{"from":"mkt-12","kind":"blank","prompt":"Unless the customer ___ on time, the story will move to June.","options":["approves","doesn't approve","will approve"],"correct":0,"point":2,"why":{"en":"approves: after 'unless', use the present with no 'not'. 'Doesn't approve' makes a double negative, and 'will approve' is wrong after unless.","tr":"approves: 'unless'ten sonra geniş zaman gelir, olumsuzluk eklenmez. 'Doesn't approve' çift olumsuz olur; 'will approve' unless'ten sonra yanlıştır.","fa":"approves درست است، چون بعد از unless زمان حال می‌آید و منفی نمی‌شود. doesn't approve منفیِ دوتایی می‌سازد و will approve بعد از unless غلط است."}}]},"writing":{"id":"c-mkt-cp-3-w","title":{"en":"One email: what worked","tr":"Tek e-posta: ne işe yaradı","fa":"یک ایمیل: چه چیزی جواب داد"},"course":"marketing","unit":"mkt-cp-3","type":"writing","difficulty":"difficult","modelBy":"FEschool","portfolio":null,"prompt":{"en":"Write an email to your manager (100-130 words) about your own last three months of content, or from these notes on a coffee brand: 12 reels and 6 newsletters published; newsletter sign-ups rose from 400 to 900; one ad said \"best coffee in the world\" and had to be pulled; a wrong delivery date got public complaints. Say what you published, one good result, one problem, what you learned and what comes next.","tr":"Yöneticine, son üç aylık içeriğin ya da bir kahve markasının şu notları hakkında e-posta yaz (100-130 kelime): 12 reel ve 6 bülten yayımlandı; bülten kayıtları 400'den 900'e çıktı; bir reklam \"best coffee in the world\" dedi ve kaldırılmak zorunda kaldı; yanlış bir teslimat tarihi herkese açık şikâyetlere yol açtı. Ne yayımladığını, iyi bir sonucu, bir sorunu, ne öğrendiğini ve sırada ne olduğunu yaz.","fa":"به مدیرت درباره‌ی محتوای سه ماه اخیر خودت، یا از روی این یادداشت‌های یک برند قهوه، ایمیل بنویس (۱۰۰ تا ۱۳۰ کلمه): ۱۲ ریلز و ۶ خبرنامه منتشر شد؛ ثبت‌نام خبرنامه از ۴۰۰ به ۹۰۰ رسید؛ یک آگهی گفته بود «best coffee in the world» و باید برداشته می‌شد؛ یک تاریخ تحویل اشتباه باعث شکایت عمومی شد. بگو چه منتشر کردی، یک نتیجه‌ی خوب، یک مشکل، چه یاد گرفتی و قدم بعدی چیست."},"model":"Subject: Three months of content\n\nHi Maya,\n\nWe have published 12 reels and 6 newsletters since March. Newsletter sign-ups have risen from 400 to 900, mostly from one care guide that we reused on three channels.\n\nNot everything worked. One ad said \"best coffee in the world\", and we had to pull it because we could not prove it. A wrong delivery date also led to public complaints.\n\nWe learned three things: check every claim, answer complaints in public, and report the goal, not the likes.\n\nNext, we will plan by pillars. If the guide format keeps working, we will make one a month.\n\nBest regards,\nSam","frame":"Subject: ___\n\nHi ___,\n\nWe have published ___ since ___. ___ have risen from ___ to ___, ___.\n\nNot everything worked. ___.\n\nWe learned ___: ___, ___ and ___.\n\nNext, ___. If ___, we will ___.\n\nBest regards,\n___","words":[{"word":"have risen"},{"word":"learned"},{"word":"if"}],"minWords":95,"minSentences":6,"rubric":["Task done: what was published, one good result, one problem, what you learned, what comes next","Organised: results, problems, lessons, next step, each in its own paragraph","Language: present perfect for results so far, past simple for events, if for the plan","Tone: honest and calm; numbers instead of big words"],"rubricI18n":{"tr":["Görev: ne yayımlandığı, iyi bir sonuç, bir sorun, ne öğrenildiği, sırada ne olduğu","Düzen: sonuçlar, sorunlar, dersler, sonraki adım; her biri ayrı paragrafta","Dil: şimdiye kadarki sonuçlar için present perfect, olaylar için past simple, plan için if","Üslup: dürüst ve sakin; büyük laflar yerine rakamlar"],"fa":["کامل بودن کار: چه منتشر شده، یک نتیجه‌ی خوب، یک مشکل، چه یاد گرفته شده، قدم بعدی","نظم: نتایج، مشکل‌ها، درس‌ها، قدم بعدی، هر کدام در یک پاراگراف","زبان: حال کامل برای نتایج تا امروز، گذشته‌ی ساده برای اتفاق‌ها، if برای برنامه","لحن: صادق و آرام؛ عدد به‌جای کلمه‌های بزرگ"]}},"speaking":{"id":"mkt-cp-3","course":"marketing","unit":"mkt-cp-3","topic":{"en":"Three questions about your work","tr":"İşinle ilgili üç soru","fa":"سه سؤال درباره‌ی کار تو"},"warmup":{"en":"What is the best thing you wrote in this course?","tr":"Bu kursta yazdığın en iyi şey neydi?","fa":"بهترین چیزی که در این دوره نوشتی چه بود؟"},"questions":[{"en":"\"What was your biggest mistake, and what did you learn from it?\"","tr":"\"What was your biggest mistake, and what did you learn from it?\"","fa":"«What was your biggest mistake, and what did you learn from it?»"},{"en":"\"What should we never let an AI tool do alone?\"","tr":"\"What should we never let an AI tool do alone?\"","fa":"«What should we never let an AI tool do alone?»"},{"en":"\"What will you do first next month?\"","tr":"\"What will you do first next month?\"","fa":"«What will you do first next month?»"}],"followups":[{"en":"Answer the same three questions about your own real work.","tr":"Aynı üç soruyu kendi gerçek işin için cevapla.","fa":"به همین سه سؤال درباره‌ی کار واقعی خودت جواب بده."}],"expressions":[{"phrase":"My biggest mistake was...","meaning":{"en":"Names it first.","tr":"Önce hatayı söyler.","fa":"اول اشتباه را می‌گوید."}},{"phrase":"What I learned is to...","meaning":{"en":"Turns it into a rule.","tr":"Hatayı bir kurala çevirir.","fa":"آن را به یک قاعده تبدیل می‌کند."}},{"phrase":"It's great for..., but it should never...","meaning":{"en":"Sets a clear limit.","tr":"Net bir sınır koyar.","fa":"یک حد روشن می‌گذارد."}}],"model":"My biggest mistake was publishing a claim I hadn't checked. It said best in the world, and we had to pull it. What I learned is to check every claim before it goes out. An AI tool is great for first drafts and headline ideas, but it should never write facts about our products alone. Next month, I'll start by planning our pillars.","selfCheck":[{"en":"I named one mistake and what I learned.","tr":"Bir hatayı ve ne öğrendiğimi söyledim.","fa":"یک اشتباه و چیزی را که از آن یاد گرفتم گفتم."},{"en":"I said what an AI tool can and cannot do.","tr":"Yapay zekânın neyi yapıp yapamayacağını söyledim.","fa":"گفتم ابزار هوش مصنوعی چه می‌تواند بکند و چه نمی‌تواند."},{"en":"I gave one clear next step.","tr":"Net bir sonraki adım söyledim.","fa":"یک قدم بعدی روشن گفتم."},{"en":"Round 3 fitted in the time.","tr":"3. tur süreye sığdı.","fa":"دور سوم را در زمان تعیین‌شده تمام کردم."}]}}; })(globalThis.COURSE_FILES = globalThis.COURSE_FILES || {});
